{"3126170": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cyber Paranoia", "steam_appid": 3126170, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to a unique psychiatric treatment facility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In &quot;Cyber Paranoia,&quot; you've been hospitalized for a mental contagion and selected as a test subject for experimental therapy. Your doctor introduces you to what appears to be a perfect young man - but he's actually a humanoid android.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll participate in various &quot;treatment sessions&quot; with this android, ranging from tender care to intense punitive experiences, as you navigate the thin, dangerous line between love, submission, pain, and control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126170/extras/e16b4548980e2080cdfc9147d1c3a6d6.poster.avif?t=1786298194\" width=1000 height=560 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126170/extras/e16b4548980e2080cdfc9147d1c3a6d6.webm?t=1786298194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126170/extras/e16b4548980e2080cdfc9147d1c3a6d6.mp4?t=1786298194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision you make will shape the android's responses and destiny - and ultimately determine your own fate.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Target Audience</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fans of dark otome and female-targeted content</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players interested in power dynamics and psychological themes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Those who enjoy yandere characters, android romance, and sci-fi psychological thrillers</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>300,000+ words of story content</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>150+ CG illustrations (including variations)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>80+ character sprites with expression and pose variations</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>40+ therapy and treatment activities</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>30+ unique endings</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>6 character stat development paths</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>6 outfit changes</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10+ hours of gameplay for full completion</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126170/extras/636bb64b00c07aa7fe4511271e499c08.poster.avif?t=1786298194\" width=1000 height=564 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126170/extras/636bb64b00c07aa7fe4511271e499c08.webm?t=1786298194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126170/extras/636bb64b00c07aa7fe4511271e499c08.mp4?t=1786298194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich Interactions</strong>: Choose from dozens of treatment options spanning gentle care, disciplinary sessions, sensory experiences, romantic encounters, and mechanical procedures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete Control</strong>: Manage your daily routine - schedule treatments, take breaks, submit progress reports, or engage in secret after-hours interactions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Character Evolution</strong>: Watch the android's personality transform ba